{
  "title": "Imam al-Sadiq's supplication",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "يَا صَانِعَ كُلِّ مَصْنُوْعٍ يَا جَابِرَ كُلِّ كَسِيْرٍ وَ يَا حَاضِرَ كُلِّ مَلَاٍ وَ يَا شَاهِدَ كُلِّ نَجْوٰى وَ يَا عَالِمَ كُلِّ خَفِيَّةٍ وَ يَا شَاهِدًا غَيْرَ غَاۤئِبٍ وَ يَا غَالِبًا غَيْرَ مَغْلُوبٍ وَ يَا قَرِيْبًا غَيْرَ بَعِيْدٍ وَ يَا مُوْنِسَ كُلِّ وَحِيْدٍ وَ يَا حَيُّ مُحْيِيَ الْمَوْتٰى وَ مُمِيْتَ الْاَحْيَاۤءِ الْقَاۤئِمَ عَلٰى كُلِّ نَفْسٍ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ وَ يَا حَيًّا حِيْنَ لَا حَيَّ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ۔\nYAA SAANI-A' KULLI MASNOO', YAA JAABIRA KULLI KASEER, WA YAA HAADIRA KULLI MALAA, WA YAA SHAAHIDA KULLI NAJWAA, WA YAA A'ALIMA KULLI KHAFIYYAH, WA YAA SHAAHIDAN GHAYRA GHAAA-IB, WA YAA GHAALIBAN GHAYRA MAGHLOOB, WA YAA QAREEBAN GHAYRA BA-I'D, WA YAA MOONISA KULLI WAHEED, WA YAA HAYYU MUHYIYAL MAWTAA WA MUMEETAL AHYAAA-IL QAAA-IMA A'LAA KULLI NAFSIM BIMAA KASABAT, WA YAA HAYYAN HEENA LAA HAYY, LAAA ILAAHA ILLAAA ANT, SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD.\nO Maker of everything made! O Mender of everything broken! O Present at every gathering! O Witness of every secret talk! O Knower of every hidden matter! O Ever-present, never absent! O Ever-triumphant, never defeated! O Ever-near, never far! O Companion of every lonely one! O Living One, Reviver of the dead and Bringer of death to the living, Watching every soul for what it has earned! O Living when there was no living thing! There is no god but You. Bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad."
}
